14 questions the documents alone must answer, bisected stage by stage.

                                     in corpus  retrieved  gold ctx  real ctx
  What is the racked storage capac         yes        yes     WRONG        ok
  What is the total capacity of th         yes        yes     WRONG        ok
  What was utilisation at the Colu         yes        yes     WRONG        ok
  Under MSC-2022-100, how much can         yes        yes        ok     WRONG
  How much written notice is requi         yes        yes        ok     WRONG
  How long does the buyer have to          yes        yes        ok        ok
  What is the supplier's liability         yes        yes        ok        ok
  What on-time delivery rate does          yes         NO        ok     WRONG
  What happens if a supplier misse         yes        yes        ok        ok
  What are the payment terms under         yes         NO        ok     WRONG
